# BORGHERTZS_SNEAKY_HANDS (jeuno 49): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job THF, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 THF: CastleOztroja's Treasure Coffer opens to
# RoguesCulottes (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +2048 (bit 11); CastleZvahlBaileys's to
# RoguesVest: +4096 (bit 12).
lists CastleOztroja/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade CastleZvahlBaileys/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-99,-75,-129 job=THF lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsSneakyHands accepted
item OztrojaCofferKey
item ZvahlCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer OztrojaCofferKey x1 # bit 11 unset: RoguesCulottes; [AF]ZilartCoffer 2048
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 110.041,-20.002,106.811 CastleZvahlBaileys
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ZvahlCofferKey x1 # bit 12 unset: RoguesVest; [AF]ZilartCoffer 6144
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
